  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orientation Visit - Aviation Ecosystem Reverse Trade Mission, through Futron Corporation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds a reverse trade mission (RTM) to introduce Thai aviation officials from the Civil Aviation Authority of Thailand, airport operators and other aviation stakeholders to U.S. equipment, solutions and best practices for aviation management. The delegates will visit multiple U.S. cities to meet with U.S. government and industry, and participate in site visits to airports.</narrative>
  </description>
